AWS EC2 Instance
Ubuntu EC2 instance deployed in AWS.
Wazuh Agent installed on the instance.
Collects:
System logs
Authentication events
Security events
Process activities
Wazuh Agent
Runs on the EC2 instance.
Monitors the system continuously.
Sends logs securely to the Wazuh Manager.
Wazuh Manager
Central analysis engine.
Receives logs from agents.
Applies detection rules.
Generates security alerts.
Wazuh Indexer
Stores all collected events.
Enables fast searching and analytics.
Maintains historical security data.
Wazuh Dashboard
Web-based monitoring interface.
Displays:
Connected agents
Alerts
Security events
Threat hunting data
Security Analyst
Accesses the dashboard.
Investigates alerts.
Monitors infrastructure health.
Performs threat hunting.
